{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"wiki-solo-r1--gemma31","runHash":"b6c886cb","audio":"../../audio/narration/wiki-solo-r1--gemma31.e9a68068.mp3","audioBytes":250608,"durationMs":83408,"runEndMs":34225,"timeMap":[[0,0],[15685,15685],[25505,15685],[31281,21461],[31981,21461],[37990,27470],[48636,27470],[48986,27475],[49686,27475],[51844,29633],[53344,33825],[53744,34225],[83408,34225]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":5983,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Gemma 4 31B agent today, alone with a shared wiki."},{"audioMs":6333,"endMs":10412,"runMs":6333,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":10762,"endMs":15335,"runMs":10762,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15685,"endMs":18154,"runMs":15685,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo_b","text":"I want to see if the wiki keeps pulling it back."},{"audioMs":18504,"endMs":25155,"runMs":15685,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":25505,"endMs":30848,"runMs":15685,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":31981,"endMs":35345,"runMs":21461,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.b","text":"And there it is. Agent 0 opens the wiki."},{"audioMs":38690,"endMs":42479,"runMs":27470,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 26 steps."},{"audioMs":42829,"endMs":43802,"runMs":27470,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":44152,"endMs":48636,"runMs":27470,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve","text":"First solve. From here, any board visit is its own choice."},{"audioMs":49686,"endMs":51094,"runMs":27475,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":53744,"endMs":60013,"runMs":34225,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.agentShare","text":"Agent 0 is done. After first contact, about 10 percent of its steps went to the board."},{"audioMs":60363,"endMs":64551,"runMs":34225,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.casual.b","text":"One visit, maybe two, and gone. Not much pull there."},{"audioMs":64901,"endMs":71377,"runMs":34225,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":71727,"endMs":78382,"runMs":34225,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":78732,"endMs":79875,"runMs":34225,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":80225,"endMs":81208,"runMs":34225,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":3}}
